  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>EstimateScopeAI </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>EstimateScopeAI — Smart Project Auditor</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview:</b> EstimateScopeAI adalah alat audit proyek tingkat enterprise yang dirancang untuk membantu tim manajemen menghitung estimasi biaya dan waktu pengembangan secara akurat. Dengan integrasi AI, aplikasi ini mampu menganalisis kompleksitas fitur dan memberikan cakupan proyek yang presisi.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem):</b> Kesalahan dalam estimasi proyek sering kali menyebabkan pembengkakan anggaran dan keterlambatan rilis. Metode audit manual sangat memakan waktu dan rentan terhadap <i data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"189\">human error</i>, terutama pada proyek skala besar yang memiliki ribuan baris kebutuhan teknis.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Engineering &amp; AI):</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scalable Backend:</b> Menggunakan <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">.NET 8</b> untuk memastikan proses audit berjalan di lingkungan yang aman, terstruktur, dan siap untuk beban kerja berat.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">AI-Driven Analytics:</b> Mengintegrasikan <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"38\">Gemini AI API</b> untuk memproses deskripsi fitur dan menghasilkan breakdown teknis serta estimasi jam kerja secara otomatis.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reactive Frontend:</b> Dibangun dengan <b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Angular 19</b> menggunakan <i data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Signals</i> untuk memastikan sinkronisasi data audit yang instan dan UI yang sangat responsif.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://estimatescopeai-production.up.railway.app/home\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"8\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzgtMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/8-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/8-2.png\" alt=\"8\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"9\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzktMi5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIwOGI5ZTA0In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9-2.png\" alt=\"9\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"10\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3NiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEwLTIucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10-2.png\" alt=\"10\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"11\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk3NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzExLTIucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/11-2.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/11-2.png\" alt=\"11\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>A sophisticated auditing platform that reduces project planning time by up to <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">60%</b>. By leveraging AI, EstimateScopeAI delivers higher estimation accuracy, minimizes the risk of under-budgeting, and provides full transparency for both development teams and clients in understanding the technical scope of any application.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Tech Stack</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    .NET 8\n    Angular 19\n    Gemini AI\n    SQL Server\n<style>\n.kh-stack-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n}\n.kh-badge {\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.kh-badge:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n/* EstimateScopeAI Colors */\n.dotnet { background-color: #512bd4; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #673ab7; }\n.angular { background-color: #dd0031; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #ff1744; }\n.ai { background-color: #ffffff; color: #1a73e8; border: 1px solid #1a73e8; }\n.sql { background-color: #00758f; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #00acc1; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    🤖 AI Integration\n    📊 Business Intelligence\n    🛡️ Enterprise Audit\n    📉 Risk Management\n<style>\n.topic-container-horizontal {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.topic-icon { margin-right: 8px; font-size: 16px; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n            Enterprise Architecture (.NET 8)\n            100%\n            Reactive Frontend (Angular 19)\n            100%\n            AI Prompt Engineering\n            100%\n<style>\n.skills-used-container { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 20px 0; }\n.skill-item { margin-bottom: 15px; }\n.skill-info {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #ffffff; /* Teks Putih */\n}\n.progress-bar-v2 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.progress-fill-v2 {\n    height: 100%;\n    background-color: #50FFD9;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(80, 255, 217, 0.4);\n    transition: width 1.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">AI Scoping Engine:</b> Breakdown otomatis fitur proyek menjadi sub-task teknis menggunakan LLM.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Budgeting Insights:</b> Estimasi biaya real-time berdasarkan kompleksitas stack yang dipilih.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Audit Reports:</b> Laporan audit yang komprehensif untuk presentasi stakeholder.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Enterprise Security:</b> Autentikasi dan otorisasi tingkat tinggi untuk melindungi data internal perusahaan.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
}